{"answer":null,"concept_id":"tf32-precision-choice","content_sha256":"sha256:1e026d329bc4ac53d8732e5e4932868b22a907416d7d8c6019385bdfd3adb3b1","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789332404.330466,"domain":"operator-development","explanation":"TF32 保留 FP32 的指数域（范围不变）、截短尾数，是替代 FP32 matmul/conv 的加速路径；BF16 同样 8 位指数但软件生态更通用，FP16 精度更高但范围窄易溢出。选择看数值范围（指数位）与精度（尾数位）需求及硬件代际（TF32 需 Ampere+）。","id":"q-operator-tf32-precision-choice-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"TF32 = FP32 的 8 位指数 + 10 位尾数，动态范围与 FP32 相同、精度高于 FP16，适合在 Ampere+ 上透明加速 FP32 矩阵运算；需要更高吞吐且数值范围允许时再用 FP16/BF16"},{"id":"b","text":"TF32 的精度高于 FP32"},{"id":"c","text":"TF32 与 FP16 完全等价"},{"id":"d","text":"TF32 在所有架构 GPU 上都可用"}],"prompt":"TF32、FP16/FP16、FP32 之间应如何选择？","schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"tradeoff","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NVIDIA CUDA C++ Programming Guide","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-programming-guide/"},{"kind":"public_interview_topic","title":"NVIDIA CUDA interview topics","url":"https://huru.ai/nvidia-interview-questions-mastering-cuda-inference-systems"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"precision","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
